+    "reduction": None,
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "reduction recognition",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "For diameter two, consecutive radio labels must trace a Hamiltonian "
+        "path in the antipodal graph; without recognizing that equivalence, "
+        "a solver confronts all pairwise radio inequalities."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track A: Theorem 2.4 makes the task Hamiltonian-path search in the "
+        "cubic planar antipodal graph, the variable-size regime underlying "
+        "Garey-Johnson-Tarjan planar cubic Hamiltonicity; at shipping size "
+        "the measured construction-aware perfect-matching search exhausts "
+        "200001 nodes on each of eight audit seeds (the distributional "
