+| demo | 8 | 8 | hand example; harden skips it |
+| easy | 120 | 120 | first oracle rung; calls blocked before attempts |
+| medium | 180 | 180 | local gates supported |
+| hard | 240 | 240 | provisional shipping preset; all local gates pass |
