The family uses the paper’s Theorem 2.4: radio graceful labelings of diameter-two graphs correspond to Hamiltonian paths in their antipodal graphs. Instances are complements of inverse-generated planar cubic Hamiltonian graphs. [Paper full text](https://arxiv.org/html/2510.00228v1)

